          "id": "nt-5",
          "type": "text",
          "data": {
            "html": "<p>After four years of campaigning, 2,300 signatures and one very long council meeting, the city voted on Tuesday to build a 2.4 km two-way protected lane from the ferry terminal to the Town Hall. Work starts in March.</p>",
